  <data name="WhisperUseGpuCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>GPU acceleration</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperUseGpuCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Faster transcription through Vulkan. Turn off if you see instability or crashes.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadEnabledCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Trim silence around speech</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadEnabledCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Silero keeps only the spoken part of each utterance before it reaches the model.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadThresholdCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Detector confidence</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadThresholdCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How sure the voice detector must be, from 0 to 1 (a probability, not a loudness), to keep a stretch of a cut utterance as speech. Higher can clip soft speech.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadMinSpeechCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Minimum speech</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadMinSpeechCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Shorter speech is dropped as a blip, like a click or a tap.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadMinSilenceCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Minimum silence</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadMinSilenceCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A shorter pause does not split speech, so a breath is bridged.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadSpeechPadCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Speech padding</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperVadSpeechPadCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Audio kept on each side of speech, so a word's start or end is not clipped.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperSuppressNstCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Remove sound tags</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperSuppressNstCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Tags like [Music] or (laughter) that Whisper sometimes adds.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperSuppressBlankCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Drop empty segments</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperSuppressBlankCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Segments of spaces or punctuation only.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperSuppressRegexCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Remove a pattern</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperSuppressRegexCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Text matching this regular expression is removed from every transcription.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperUseContextCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Carry context between segments</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperUseContextCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Each segment primes the next, for consistent wording. Turn off if the text starts repeating itself.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperMaxTokensCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Maximum tokens per segment</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperMaxTokensCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>-1 removes the limit.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperUseBeamSearchCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Explore several hypotheses at once</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperUseBeamSearchCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Beam search keeps the best of several candidate sequences. More accurate, a little slower.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperBeamSizeCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Number of hypotheses</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperBeamSizeCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Higher is more accurate and slower.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperTemperatureCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Temperature</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperTemperatureCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Randomness of the decoding. Raise it only if the model keeps repeating a phrase.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperTemperatureIncrementCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Retry temperature step</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperTemperatureIncrementCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>An uncertain segment is retried with this much more randomness each time.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperEntropyCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Entropy threshold</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperEntropyCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A segment with less word diversity than this is retried at a higher temperature. Raise it to catch subtler repetitions.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperLogprobCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Minimum confidence</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperLogprobCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A segment decoded below this average confidence is retried at a higher temperature. Closer to 0 is stricter.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperNoSpeechCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>No-speech threshold</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperNoSpeechCard.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A segment the model hears as silence, with low confidence, is dropped. Lower drops more.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WhisperModelsDirCard.Header" xml:space="preserve">
